WEBVTT

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:33.816
„Bio sam toliko toga

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:35.560
tokom mog neobičnog putovanja:

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:39.256
siromašni dečak, crnčuga,

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:42.096
čovek sa Jejla, čovek sa Harvarda,

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:44.736
peder, hrišćanin,

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:46.856
dete ovisnice o kreku, navodno,

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:49.856
potomak Satane, drugi Hristov dolazak,

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:51.080
Kejsi.“

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:53.296
To je tek šesta strana.

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:55.016
(Smeh)

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:57.080
Pa možete da razumete majčinu zabrinutost.

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:03.856
Međutim, htela je samo da unese
jednu malu ispravku.